[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4750425285","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120445#issuecomment-4750425285","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120445","id":4750425285,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGyW8xQ","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-19T09:45:16Z","updated_at":"2026-06-19T09:45:16Z","body":"Please provide an MRP to make this easier to test and fix:\n- A small Godot project which reproduces the issue, with no unnecessary files included. Be sure to not include the `.godot` folder in the archive (but keep `project.godot`).\n- Having an MRP is very important for contributors to be able to reproduce the bug in the same way that you are experiencing it. When testing a potential fix for the issue, contributors will use the MRP to validate that the fix is working as intended.\n- Drag and drop a ZIP archive to upload it (max 10 MB). **Do not select another field until the project is done uploading.**\n- **Note for C# users:** If your issue is *not* C#-specific, please upload a minimal reproduction project written in GDScript. This will make it easier for contributors to reproduce the issue locally as not everyone has a .NET setup available.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4750425285/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4750493734","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120445#issuecomment-4750493734","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120445","id":4750493734,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGybIJg","user":{"login":"Xinart","id":36197906,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MTk3OTA2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36197906?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xinart","html_url":"https://github.com/Xinart","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xinart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xinart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xinart/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xinart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xinart/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xinart/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xinart/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xinart/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xinart/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-19T09:55:02Z","updated_at":"2026-06-19T09:55:02Z","body":"Sorry, here is the MRP\n\n[bug-repport-issue-120445.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/29132219/bug-repport-issue-120445.zip)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4750493734/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4754681360","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120445#issuecomment-4754681360","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120445","id":4754681360,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABG2auEA","user":{"login":"kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-19T21:00:00Z","updated_at":"2026-06-19T21:00:00Z","body":"- Can reproduce, probably caused by https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115980\n\nIt happens in floating docks too, not just the ScriptEditor.\n\nThe previous behavior was a bug, inputs from floating windows should not be sent to the main window.\nIf you make a scene with a Window, you will see it is normal that inputs in the child Window do not get sent to the parent.\n\nHowever in the editor, you can use `_shortcut_input` to get events from child windows, if they haven't been accepted already.\nOtherwise, the best way I know to get inputs from child windows is to find each Window that you care about and connect to all of their `window_input` signals.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4754681360/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4757521762","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120445#issuecomment-4757521762","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120445","id":4757521762,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABG5IFYg","user":{"login":"Xinart","id":36197906,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MTk3OTA2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36197906?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xinart","html_url":"https://github.com/Xinart","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xinart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xinart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xinart/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xinart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xinart/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xinart/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xinart/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xinart/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xinart/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-20T11:19:10Z","updated_at":"2026-06-20T11:19:10Z","body":"Thank you a lot for your response it make sense!\n\nOn my side it seems like using _shortcut_input was workin, and sometimes not working, but ising _shortcut_input & window_input signal connect works to cover all the cases : `SignalBus.psychic_world_change_started.connect(_on_psychic_world_change_started)`\n\nAnyway thank your for your support i'll close the issue as it is not a bug but more a behavior changed from 4.6 to cover a bug","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4757521762/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]